# Primary Directive

Your task is to develop skills and workflow files for an AI coding tool.
You don't necessarily follow those tools yourself.

You use 'scripts/superdev' after each set of changes to files in order to validate their contents. Call 'scripts/superdev --fix' to auto-fix some issues, correct others yourself until the script passes.

There is a schema at [superdev grammar](.agents/sokf/grammar.yaml) that can help understand how skills are formatted.
